        "description": "<p>Several of Meta&#39;s VR studios have been affected by the company&#39;s metaverse-focused layoffs. The company has shuttered three of its VR studios, including Armature, Sanzaru and Twisted Pixel. VR fitness app Supernatural will no longer be updated with fresh content.</p><p>Employees at Twisted Pixel, which released <em>Marvel&#39;s Deadpool VR</em> in November, and Sanzaru, known for <em>Asgard&#39;s Wrath</em>, <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://x.com/andyTHPS/status/2011091620314431519\" data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\">posted</a> on <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"link rapid-with-clickid\" href=\"https://shopping.yahoo.com/rdlw?merchantId=6deefbf2-941b-4156-9f41-a61ebb50d13d&amp;siteId=us-engadget&amp;pageId=1p-autolink&amp;contentUuid=ac7129ad-5b4d-4ae8-b8a4-80cc0b970d30&amp;featureId=text-link&amp;merchantName=LinkedIn&amp;linkText=social+media&amp;custData=eyJzb3VyY2VOYW1lIjoiV2ViLURlc2t0b3AtVmVyaXpvbiIsImxhbmRpbmdVcmwiOiJodHRwczovL3d3dy5saW5rZWRpbi5jb20vcG9zdHMvcmF5LXdlc3QtYjV",
